exports[`accordion_richtext cards baseline — frozen > LIVE_POLICIES ar 1`] = `"<section class="px-4 py-bk-section"><div class="space-y-bk-sm"><div class="bento-card bg-white relative p-0 overflow-hidden" style="border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-card, 1.25rem);box-shadow:var(--bk-shadow-card, 4px 4px 0px 0px #1a1a1a);background-color:#ffffff;color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a)"><details class="group" name="accordion-_R_0_" open=""><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 text-start transition-opacity duration-bk-fast motion-reduce:transition-none active:opacity-70 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex-1 font-display font-black text-base sm:text-lg bk-caps leading-tight text-balance">سياسة الدفع عند الاستلام</span><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-bk-base motion-reduce:transition-none group-open:rotate-45" style="background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-accent, #ffd84a) 55%, var(--bk-surface, #fff));color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-input, 0.75rem)"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">add</span></span></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-3 text-bk-ink-soft" style="border-top:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a) 10%, transparent)"><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>يتم الدفع حصراً بعد استلام العطر واختباره من خلال العينة الزجاجية المرفقة مجاناُ مع كل طلب.</span></p></div></details></div><div class="bento-card bg-white relative p-0 overflow-hidden" style="border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-card, 1.25rem);box-shadow:var(--bk-shadow-card, 4px 4px 0px 0px #1a1a1a);background-color:#ffffff;color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a)"><details class="group" name="accordion-_R_0_"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 text-start transition-opacity duration-bk-fast motion-reduce:transition-none active:opacity-70 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex-1 font-display font-black text-base sm:text-lg bk-caps leading-tight text-balance">شحن فائق السرعة</span><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-bk-base motion-reduce:transition-none group-open:rotate-45" style="background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-primary, #ff5a8a) 22%, var(--bk-surface, #fff));color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-input, 0.75rem)"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">add</span></span></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-3 text-bk-ink-soft" style="border-top:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a) 10%, transparent)"><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>أغلب الطلبات توصل خلال ٢٤ ساعة من تثبيت الطلب.</span></p></div></details></div><div class="bento-card bg-white relative p-0 overflow-hidden" style="border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-card, 1.25rem);box-shadow:var(--bk-shadow-card, 4px 4px 0px 0px #1a1a1a);background-color:#ffffff;color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a)"><details class="group" name="accordion-_R_0_"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 text-start transition-opacity duration-bk-fast motion-reduce:transition-none active:opacity-70 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex-1 font-display font-black text-base sm:text-lg bk-caps leading-tight text-balance">كرت الضمان المميز و سياسة الاسترجاع</span><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-bk-base motion-reduce:transition-none group-open:rotate-45" style="background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-success, #25d366) 28%, var(--bk-surface, #fff));color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-input, 0.75rem)"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">add</span></span></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-3 text-bk-ink-soft" style="border-top:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a) 10%, transparent)"><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>عند استلام المنتج يتم التأكد من الجودة والمواصفات والفوحان والثبات بحضور المندوب, اي اختلاف يحق للزبون رفض المنتج ويتم ارجاع قيمته كاملة.</span></p><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>ويحق للزبون استعمال العطر والاحتفاظ به لمدة اسبوع كامل من تاريخ استلام الطلب واختباره من راحة منزله. ان لم تعجبه التجربة العطرية او اكتشافه لفرق بالمواصفات المذكورة يحق له ارجاع العطر واستلام قيمته من قبلنا.</span></p></div></details></div><div class="bento-card bg-white relative p-0 overflow-hidden" style="border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-card, 1.25rem);box-shadow:var(--bk-shadow-card, 4px 4px 0px 0px #1a1a1a);background-color:#ffffff;color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a)"><details class="group" name="accordion-_R_0_"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 text-start transition-opacity duration-bk-fast motion-reduce:transition-none active:opacity-70 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex-1 font-display font-black text-base sm:text-lg bk-caps leading-tight text-balance">عطور اصلية</span><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-bk-base motion-reduce:transition-none group-open:rotate-45" style="background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-secondary, #3e3129) 18%, var(--bk-surface, #fff));color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-input, 0.75rem)"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">add</span></span></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-3 text-bk-ink-soft" style="border-top:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a) 10%, transparent)"><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>جميع عطورنا مختارة يدوياً وبعناية من افخم المصادر العالمية, ومن اجود انواع العطور والخامات العطرية. لا نتعامل بالعطور التركية المصنعة بالجملة او العطور الصينية الرديئة</span></p></div></details></div><div class="bento-card bg-white relative p-0 overflow-hidden" style="border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-card, 1.25rem);box-shadow:var(--bk-shadow-card, 4px 4px 0px 0px #1a1a1a);background-color:#ffffff;color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a)"><details class="group" name="accordion-_R_0_"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 text-start transition-opacity duration-bk-fast motion-reduce:transition-none active:opacity-70 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex-1 font-display font-black text-base sm:text-lg bk-caps leading-tight text-balance">خدمة العملاء</span><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-bk-base motion-reduce:transition-none group-open:rotate-45" style="background-color:var(--bk-surface-alt, #fff7ed);color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-input, 0.75rem)"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">add</span></span></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-3 text-bk-ink-soft" style="border-top:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a) 10%, transparent)"><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>سولف ويانا ! احنا موجودين بأي وقت وبكل وقت حتى نجاوب بكل حب ع اسئلتكم واستفساراتكم من خلال الواتساب</span></p></div></details></div></div></section>"`;

