color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a)"><details class="group" name="accordion-_R_0_"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 text-start transition-opacity duration-bk-fast motion-reduce:transition-none active:opacity-70 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex-1 font-display font-black text-base sm:text-lg bk-caps leading-tight text-balance">Ultra-fast shipping</span><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-bk-base motion-reduce:transition-none group-open:rotate-45" style="background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-primary, #ff5a8a) 22%, var(--bk-surface, #fff));color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-input, 0.75rem)"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">add</span></span></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-3 text-bk-ink-soft" style="border-top:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a) 10%, transparent)"><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>Most orders arrive within 24 hours of confirmation.</span></p></div></details></div><div class="bento-card bg-white relative p-0 overflow-hidden" style="border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-card, 1.25rem);box-shadow:var(--bk-shadow-card, 4px 4px 0px 0px #1a1a1a);background-color:#ffffff;color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a)"><details class="group" name="accordion-_R_0_"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 text-start transition-opacity duration-bk-fast motion-reduce:transition-none active:opacity-70 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex-1 font-display font-black text-base sm:text-lg bk-caps leading-tight text-balance">Premium warranty card &amp; return policy</span><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-bk-base motion-reduce:transition-none group-open:rotate-45" style="background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-success, #25d366) 28%, var(--bk-surface, #fff));color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-input, 0.75rem)"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">add</span></span></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-3 text-bk-ink-soft" style="border-top:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a) 10%, transparent)"><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>On delivery, quality, projection and longevity are verified with the courier present — any mismatch entitles you to refuse the product for a full refund.</span></p><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>You may keep and test the perfume for a full week from delivery; if the experience disappoints or the specs differ, return it for a full refund.</span></p></div></details></div><div class="bento-card bg-white relative p-0 overflow-hidden" style="border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-card, 1.25rem);box-shadow:var(--bk-shadow-card, 4px 4px 0px 0px #1a1a1a);background-color:#ffffff;color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a)"><details class="group" name="accordion-_R_0_"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 text-start transition-opacity duration-bk-fast motion-reduce:transition-none active:opacity-70 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex-1 font-display font-black text-base sm:text-lg bk-caps leading-tight text-balance">Authentic perfumes</span><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-bk-base motion-reduce:transition-none group-open:rotate-45" style="background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-secondary, #3e3129) 18%, var(--bk-surface, #fff));color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-input, 0.75rem)"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">add</span></span></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-3 text-bk-ink-soft" style="border-top:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a) 10%, transparent)"><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>Every perfume is hand-picked from premium global sources and the finest aromatic materials. We never deal in bulk-made or low-grade imitations.</span></p></div></details></div><div class="bento-card bg-white relative p-0 overflow-hidden" style="border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-card, 1.25rem);box-shadow:var(--bk-shadow-card, 4px 4px 0px 0px #1a1a1a);background-color:#ffffff;color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a)"><details class="group" name="accordion-_R_0_"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 text-start transition-opacity duration-bk-fast motion-reduce:transition-none active:opacity-70 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex-1 font-display font-black text-base sm:text-lg bk-caps leading-tight text-balance">Customer care</span><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-bk-base motion-reduce:transition-none group-open:rotate-45" style="background-color:var(--bk-surface-alt, #fff7ed);color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-input, 0.75rem)"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">add</span></span></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-3 text-bk-ink-soft" style="border-top:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a) 10%, transparent)"><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>Talk to us! We are available around the clock to answer your questions with love, over WhatsApp.</span></p></div></details></div></div></section>"`;

exports[`accordion_richtext cards baseline — frozen > defaultProps allow_multiple ar 1`] = `"<section class="px-4 py-bk-section"><div class="mb-bk-lg flex flex-col gap-bk-xs items-start text-start"><h2 data-i18n-field="heading_i18n" class="font-display font-black text-balance text-bk-h2" style="color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);font-family:var(--bk-font-display, inherit)">التفاصيل</h2></div><div class="space-y-bk-sm"><div class="bento-card bg-white relative p-0 overflow-hidden" style="border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-card, 1.25rem);box-shadow:var(--bk-shadow-card, 4px 4px 0px 0px #1a1a1a);background-color:#ffffff;color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a)"><details class="group" open=""><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 text-start transition-opacity duration-bk-fast motion-reduce:transition-none active:opacity-70 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex-1 font-display font-black text-base sm:text-lg bk-caps leading-tight text-balance">الشحن</span><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-bk-base motion-reduce:transition-none group-open:rotate-45" style="background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-accent, #ffd84a) 55%, var(--bk-surface, #fff));color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-input, 0.75rem)"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">add</span></span></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-3 text-bk-ink-soft" style="border-top:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a) 10%, transparent)"><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>توصيل بنفس اليوم في بغداد للطلبات قبل الرابعة عصراً.</span></p><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>بقية المحافظات خلال 1-3 أيام عمل.</span></p></div></details></div><div class="bento-card bg-white relative p-0 overflow-hidden" style="border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-card, 1.25rem);box-shadow:var(--bk-shadow-card, 4px 4px 0px 0px #1a1a1a);background-color:#ffffff;color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a)"><details class="group"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 text-start transition-opacity duration-bk-fast motion-reduce:transition-none active:opacity-70 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex-1 font-display font-black text-base sm:text-lg bk-caps leading-tight text-balance">الإرجاع</span><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-bk-base motion-reduce:transition-none group-open:rotate-45" style="background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-primary, #ff5a8a) 22%, var(--bk-surface, #fff));color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-input, 0.75rem)"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">add</span></span></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-3 text-bk-ink-soft" style="border-top:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a) 10%, transparent)"><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>إرجاع مجاني خلال 14 يوماً للمنتجات غير المفتوحة.</span></p><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>تواصل مع الدعم لبدء عملية الإرجاع.</span></p></div></details></div></div></section>"`;

