n 1–3 working days.</span></p></div></details></div><div class="bento-card bg-white relative p-0 overflow-hidden" style="border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-card, 1.25rem);box-shadow:var(--bk-shadow-card, 4px 4px 0px 0px #1a1a1a);background-color:#ffffff;color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a)"><details class="group" name="accordion-_R_0_"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 text-start transition-opacity duration-bk-fast motion-reduce:transition-none active:opacity-70 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex-1 font-display font-black text-base sm:text-lg bk-caps leading-tight text-balance">Returns</span><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-bk-base motion-reduce:transition-none group-open:rotate-45" style="background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-primary, #ff5a8a) 22%, var(--bk-surface, #fff));color:var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) solid var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a);border-radius:var(--bk-radius-input, 0.75rem)"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">add</span></span></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-3 text-bk-ink-soft" style="border-top:var(--bk-border-thickness, 3px) dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--bk-ink, #1a1a1a) 10%, transparent)"><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>14-day free returns on unopened items.</span></p><p class="mb-3 last:mb-0 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-pretty"><span>Contact support to start a return.</span></p></div></details></div></div></section>"`;
